return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-10T13:58:16+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-10T13:58:16+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Sabuntawar oda ta SMS da WhatsApp don shagon ku, wanda aka aiko ta Zinn® Campaigns a ƙarƙashin sunan shagon ku. Haɗa tare da dannawa ɗaya; babu maɓallan da za a liƙa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Sabuntawar oda','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Shagon ku yana haɗe da Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'An cire haɗin kantin ku. Ba za a aika saƙonni ba.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Wannan haɗin ya ɗauki lokaci mai tsawo ko kuma an fara shi a wani burauzar daban. Latsa Haɗa kuma.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® bai karɓi haɗin ba. Latsa "Haɗa" kuma; idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, tuntuɓi tallafin Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Shafinku ya kasa samun damar shiga Zinn®. Ku duba ko mai masaukin bakinku yana ba da damar haɗin waje, sannan ku danna «Sake haɗawa».','Help'=>'Taimako','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Aika wa abokan cinikinka sabuntawa ta SMS da WhatsApp game da ododinsu, a ƙarƙashin sunan shagonka, wanda aka biya daga kiredit ɗinka na Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Haɗa yana buɗe Zinn® a wannan taga. Shiga ko ƙirƙiri asusu, amince da wannan shago, kuma za ku dawo nan kai tsaye. Ba za ku taɓa liƙa mabuɗi ba.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Haɗa zuwa Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'An haɗa, amma ba a iya samun Zinn® ba a yanzu. Za mu sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba.','Store'=>'Kanti','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'A buɗe don asusunka','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Ba a buɗe wa asusunka ba tukuna. Zinn® zai aiko maka da imel idan an buɗe.','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗi','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan shagon ba.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin cire haɗin wannan kantin ba.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Aika mini sabuntawar oda ta hanyar SMS zuwa lambar wayata. Za a iya amfani da kuɗin saƙo da bayanai. Bada amsa da STOP don tsayawa.','Connection'=>'Haɗi','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin yin hakan ba.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'Na gode. Yanzu za ku iya neman taimako kuma ku aika da rahotanni zuwa goyon bayan Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'An janye amincewa. Ba za a aika komai zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn® ba har sai kun sake amincewa.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'Zinn® AI ba ta iya ba da amsa a yanzu ba. Aika tambayarka ga ƙungiyar da ke ƙasa; mutum zai ba da amsa.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Muna farin ciki da hakan ya magance shi.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'An aika. Tikitinku shi ne %s; ƙungiyar za ta ba da amsa a nan da kuma ta imel.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Cika batun, saƙon sannan, yayin da shagonka bai haɗu ba, adireshin imel ɗinka.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® bai karɓi tikitin ba. Duba filayen sannan ka sake gwadawa; idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, a aika imel zuwa support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Bukatu sun yi yawa cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Reply sent.'=>'An aika amsa.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Waccan tikitin tana rufe. Maimakon haka aika sabuwar tikiti.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'Ba a iya aika amsarka ba. Sake gwadawa an jima kaɗan.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Ana jiran tallafin Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Ana jiranku','Answered'=>'An amsa','Closed'=>'A rufe','Report a bug'=>'Ba da rahoton matsala','Send feedback'=>'Aika ra\'ayi','Request a feature'=>'Nemi wani fasali','Ask for help'=>'Nemi taimako','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Shafofin: WordPress, PHP, wannan manhaja, WooCommerce (da kuma ko tana amfani da HPOS) da kuma manhajojin da ake tallafawa da muka gano','Your active theme and its version'=>'Jigonka mai aiki da sigarsa','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Jerin manhajoji da aka girka, nau\'ikansu da kuma ko kowannensu yana aiki','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Haɗi: adireshin kantinku, ko yana haɗe, id na wannan shigarwa da kuma ko Zinn® ya amsa bincikensa na ƙarshe (ba alamar kantin ba)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Sabuntawar Oda ta Zinn®: Taimako','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Janye yardata ta aika buƙatun taimako','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Taimako a nan yana samun amsa daga Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kafin kowane abu ya bar rukunin yanar gizon ku, ga ainihin abin da ake aikawa, da kuma inda ake aikawa:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Tambayar da kuka rubuta: an aika zuwa Zinn® AI a api.zinndigital.com, wanda ke ba da amsa daga makalun taimako na Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tikitin da kuka aika: batunsa, saƙonku, yaren gudanarwarku da adireshin imel na amsa, da aka aika zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Binciken matsala: shingen da kuka yi wa alama kawai, kowanne ana nunawa gaba ɗaya kafin ku aika. Ba za a taɓa haɗa da alamar shagon, kalmomin sirri ko bayanan abokan cinikin ku ba.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Tikitin ku: yayin da shagon ku ke haɗe, wannan allon yana karanta tikitin ku da amsoshin ƙungiyar daga Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'Muna yin rikodin wanda ya amince da lokacin da ya amince. Za ku iya janyewa a kowane lokaci a kan wannan allon.','Agree and continue'=>'Yarda kuma ci gaba','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Tambayi Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Me kake buƙatar taimako a kai?','Ask'=>'Tambaya','Help articles'=>'Labaran taimako','That solved it'=>'Wannan ya warware shi','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Har yanzu kuna buƙatar taimako? Aika shi ga ƙungiyar da ke ƙasa.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'Aika shi zuwa ga ƙungiyar Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Menene wannan?','Subject'=>'Maudu\'i','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Me ya faru? Domin matsala (bug), matakan da ke nuna ta.','Reply e-mail'=>'Imel ɗin amsa','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Bar shi a wofi don amfani da adireshin imel na memba na Zinn® wanda ya haɗa wannan kanti.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Shagon ku ba shi da haɗi, don haka ƙungiyar tana ba da amsa ta imel.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Binciken matsala (na zaɓi). Yi alama a kan shinge don haɗa shi; wannan shi ne ainihin abin da aka aika.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wa goyon bayan Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Tikite na','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Haɗa shagon ku domin bin diddigin tikitocinku a nan. Har zuwa lokacin, ƙungiyar za ta ba da amsa ta hanyar imel.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'Ba a iya loda tikitocin ku ba a yanzu. Sake gwadawa nan da wani ɗan lokaci.','No tickets yet.'=>'Babu tikiti tukuna.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Tallafin Zinn® ya amsa a %s:','Your reply'=>'Amsarku','Send reply'=>'Aika amsa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® SMS and WhatsApp sign-up'=>'Yin rajistar SMS da WhatsApp na Zinn®','Lets visitors sign up for offers and news by SMS or WhatsApp. Unticked by default; marketing only.'=>'Yana bawa baƙi damar yin rajista don samun tayi da labarai ta hanyar SMS ko WhatsApp. Ba a yi masa alama ba bisa ƙa\'ida; don talla kawai.','Sign-up settings'=>'Saitunan yin rajista','Channel'=>'Tashar','SMS'=>'SMS','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Visitor chooses SMS or WhatsApp'=>'Maziyari yana zaɓar SMS ko WhatsApp','Zinn® SMS offers consent'=>'Yarda da tayin SMS na Zinn®','Zinn® WhatsApp offers consent'=>'Yarjejeniyar tayin Zinn® ta WhatsApp','Records a marketing opt-in in Zinn® Campaigns for the phone number in this form.'=>'Yana rikodin amincewar tallatawa a cikin Zinn® Campaigns don lambar wayar da ke cikin wannan fom.','Send me offers and news on WhatsApp to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Aika mini tayi da labarai ta WhatsApp zuwa wannan lambar. Na zaɓi ne; fita a kowane lokaci.','Send me offers and news by SMS to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time by replying STOP. Message and data rates may apply.'=>'Aika mini tayi da labarai ta hanyar SMS zuwa wannan lambar. Na zaɓi ne; ka fita daga rajista a kowane lokaci ta hanyar ba da amsa da STOP. Ana iya cajin kuɗin saƙo da bayanai.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns to show this sign-up form.'=>'Haɗa wannan kanti da Zinn® Campaigns domin nuna wannan fom ɗin yin rajista.','Mobile number'=>'Lambar wayar hannu','How should we send them?'=>'Ta yaya ya kamata mu aika su?','Send me offers and news by the channel I chose above. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Aika mini tayi da labarai ta hanyar tashar da na zaɓa a sama. Na zaɓi ne; za ka iya cire rajista a kowane lokaci.','Leave this empty'=>'Bar wannan a wofi','Sign up'=>'Yi rajista','Thank you, you are signed up. You can unsubscribe any time.'=>'Mun gode, an yi rajistarku. Za ku iya soke rajistar a kowane lokaci.','Please enter your mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da lambar wayarku tare da lambar ƙasa, misali +44 7700 900123.','Please tick the box to agree.'=>'Da fatan za a saka alamar kaska a akwatin don yarda.','This form was open for a long time. Please reload the page and send it again.'=>'Wannan fom ɗin ya daɗe a buɗe. Da fatan za a sake loda shafin kuma a sake aikawa.','Too many sign-ups from here. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Yawan rajista sun yi yawa daga nan. Da fatan za a jira \'yan mintuna kaɗan sannan a sake gwadawa.','We could not save your sign-up. Please check your number and try again.'=>'Ba mu iya ajiye rajistarku ba. Da fatan za a duba lambarku kuma a sake gwadawa.','my account endpoint slugmessages'=>'Saƙonni','Messages'=>'Saƙonni','Text me updates about my orders'=>'Aika mini sabuntawa game da oda ta ta hanyar saƙon tes','Text me offers and news from this store'=>'Aiko mini da tayi da labarai daga wannan shagon ta hanyar saƙon tes','Send me offers and news from this store on WhatsApp'=>'Aika mini tayi da labarai daga wannan kanti a WhatsApp','Order received'=>'An karɓi oda','Payment received'=>'An karɓi biyan kuɗi','Order on hold'=>'An dakatar da oda','Order shipped'=>'An aika da oda','Order completed'=>'An kammala oda','Ready for pickup'=>'A shirye don karɓa','Payment failed'=>'Biyan kuɗi ya gaza','Order cancelled'=>'An soke oda','Order refunded'=>'An mayar da kuɗin oda','Order update'=>'Sabunta oda','Your message settings cover the mobile number on your orders with this store. Use the number from one of your orders.'=>'Saitunan sakonninku sun shafi lambar wayar hannu da ke kan oda ku a wannan shagon. Yi amfani da lambar daga ɗaya daga cikin odar ku.','Your message settings are saved.'=>'An ajiye saitunan saƙonka.','Done. This store will not send you any more messages.'=>'An gama. Wannan shago ba zai ƙara aiko muku da wani saƙo ba.','Please enter a mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da lambar wayar hannu tare da lambar ƙasarta, misali +44 7700 900123.','We could not save your settings just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Ba mu iya adana saitunanku ba a yanzu. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da minti ɗaya.','Your message settings cannot be shown just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Ba za a iya nuna saitunan saƙonka a yanzu ba. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da minti ɗaya.','Messages from this store'=>'Saƙonni daga wannan shagon','Save'=>'Ajiye','Stop all messages'=>'Dakatar da duk saƙonni','Recent messages'=>'Saƙonnin kwanan nan','This store has not sent you any messages yet.'=>'Wannan kanti bai tura muku wani sako ba tukuna.','%1$s, order %2$s, %3$s'=>'%1$s, oda %2$s, %3$s','Sign in to manage the messages this store sends you.'=>'Shiga don sarrafa saƙonnin da wannan shago yake aiko maka.','Zinn® message settings'=>'Saitunan saƙon Zinn®','Lets a signed-in shopper change the text messages your store sends them, stop them all, and see the last 20.'=>'Yana bawa mai siyayya da ya shiga ciki damar canza saƙonnin tes da kantin ku ke tura masa, ya dakatar da su duka, sannan ya duba 20 na ƙarshe.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Littattafan jagora na mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® na WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanai ta yau da kullum, canja wurin shafi kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da kafaffun shafukan yanar gizo, yankuna da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da suka maida wannan sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta duniya ta \'yan kasuwa masu zaman kansu: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko kuma sanya aiki don su yi tayi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawar ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya isa ga dandamalin Zinn®, sannan a sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta kasa cin jarrabawar inganci kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.','Order updates'=>'Sabuntawar oda','Opted in (yes or no)'=>'An shiga (e ko a\'a)','Channel (SMS or WhatsApp)'=>'Hanya (SMS ko WhatsApp)','WhatsApp link'=>'Mahadar WhatsApp','Message us on WhatsApp'=>'Aiko mana saƙo a WhatsApp','Zinn® WhatsApp button'=>'Maɓallin WhatsApp na Zinn®','A button that opens a WhatsApp chat with your store. It shows only once your WhatsApp number is connected in Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Wani maɓalli da ke buɗe hira ta WhatsApp da shagon ku. Yana bayyana ne kawai da zarar an haɗa lambar WhatsApp ɗinku a cikin Zinn® Campaigns.','Button settings'=>'Saitunan maballi','Button text'=>'Rubutun maballi','Show to'=>'Nuna wa','Everyone'=>'Kowa','Shoppers not yet getting order updates'=>'Masu sayayya ba sa samun sabuntawar oda a halin yanzu','Connect your WhatsApp number in Zinn® Campaigns to show this button. Until then it shows nothing on your site.'=>'Haɗa lambar WhatsApp ɗinku a Zinn® Campaigns don nuna wannan maɓallin. Har sai lokacin ba zai nuna komai a rukunin yanar gizonku ba.']];